        <Param val="In this task, you will remember the locations of a disc. On some trials, the disc will move from place to place, pausing at each corner. On other trials, the disc will &quot;jump&quot; to different locations.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;After the disc returns to the cross, there will be a brief pause, and then the disc will appear at a single location. Your task is to determine whether that location is one of you've seen the disc at before (press &quot;F&quot;) or is different (press &quot;J&quot;).&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press space to continue to this part of the experiment." valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
